      "bulletId": "tb_1767189849902_y2vdfi",
      "name": "Monokuma File #1 ",
      "description": "The victim was Sayaka Maizono. The time of death is estimated to be around 1:30 a.m. The body was discovered in Makoto's room, in the dormitory.\nThe death took place in the bathroom. The cause of death was a stab wound to the abdomen, and her right wrist appears to have been fractured.",
      "imageFile": "tb_1767189849902_y2vdfi.png",
      "inversedLieBulletName": "Monokuma Phobic #1 "
    },
    {
      "bulletId": "tb_1767190002406_mcftfg",
      "name": "Evidence of a Struggle",
      "description": "There are a number of scratches and gouges on the bed and walls in Makoto's room.",
      "imageFile": "tb_1767190002406_mcftfg.png",
      "inversedLieBulletName": "Evidence of a Relaxation"
    },
    {
      "bulletId": "tb_1767191898830_13qt1k",
      "name": "Dying Message",
      "description": "A series of numbers had been written in blood on Makoto's bathroom wall—11037. It is assumed that Sayaka wrote these numbers while leaned up against the wall, as she lay dying.",
      "imageFile": "tb_1767191898830_13qt1k.png",
      "inversedLieBulletName": "Living Silence"
    },
    {
      "bulletId": "tb_1767221266351_0bg2mc",
      "name": "Loves This Game",
      "description": "He loves the game",
      "imageFile": "tb_1767221266351_0bg2mc.gif",
